Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3) Load the bootstrap kernels", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"68c2d203-2803-4790-9948-d60aa021aae5"],

Cell["\<\
The import contains the normalized KGG and KPhiGG kernels, M0 = 2 KGG, and \
the coefficient of phi in M(phi) = 2 KPhiGG. GPBootstrapData`Eta[i,j] denotes \
a metric between free index slots, not numerical components. The six-slot \
order is (lambda,mu,nu,rho,sigma,tau); the eight-slot order is \
(mu,nu,lambda,alpha,beta,rho,sigma,tau). All exported kernel indices are \
raised. The package-independent representation is converted to xAct below.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8ef366e1-430f-4e9d-b007-cc44599994ef"],

