Cell["7) Linear connection and second-order action", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"035d0442-f86e-4bbd-937d-494fa19e81af"],

Cell["\<\
g0Up represents G0^{abc} = (M0Inverse partial(phi))^{abc}. The derivative and \
field indices contracting the inverse are lowered to match its all-raised \
representation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4f4ff210-7c71-4fc5-b1fe-ebb6d0360ee6"],

