Cell["\<\
From F. T. Brandt and D. G. C. McKeon, Phys. Rev. D 93, 105037 (2016), \
arXiv:1601.04944, eqs. (3.8) and (3.10) allow the explicitly classical \
solution of G to be written in terms of the Goldberg metric as:\
\>", "Text",
